#! 固定句都是第 29 集生成用过的写法（v3 精简句 + Restraint），改之前先问总控。
【第{{@集}}集·段{{段}}】
【全局视觉风格】
{{@风格锁}}
【画面质感——高优先级】
像一部用35mm胶片实拍的电影，不是CG动画：{{材质}}；{{@颜色句}}
【实拍光影规范——高优先级】
PRACTICAL EFFECTS ONLY. Every effect must look physically shot in camera on a film set on 35mm film, never added in post.
Every light lights the faces near it, the light falling off into deep darkness. Nothing glows without lighting the world around it. {{光源}} {{@特效固定1}} {{@特效固定2}}
{{@FACING}}
Air: {{空气}}; shoot through {{前景}} so that everything feels photographed in one real space.
Real lens and real film: highlights bloom and halate with a red-orange halo, slight chromatic fringing, softer focus at the frame edges, heavy motion blur and step-printed smearing on fast action, film grain and faint scratches; the {{高光}} highlights {{@胶片后半}}
Restraint: a few large, motivated effects rather than many small ones. Every effect has a physical cause and a physical consequence.
{{@资产行}}
{{@场景块}}
【人物与表演——高优先级】
SMALL AND TRUE: real people, a camera very close; two to four small physical signals at a time, never mimed, never a blank face. THREE LAYERS: a key reaction is a flicker, then the feeling leaking out, then control. The listener is always acting too, lips closed.
{{@人物句}}
Every named character appears exactly once.
ENGLISH ONLY: every spoken word is in {{@语言}}, never Chinese; background people make only wordless sounds ({{背景声词|gasps, breath, laughter}}).{{@台词声明}}
【空间与视线——最高优先级】
SPACE: {{空间}}
EYELINES: {{视线}} In singles each eyeline passes just beside the lens. Every look has a target in the scene.
【戏的逻辑——高优先级】
SCENE LOGIC: {{逻辑}}
【镜头衔接——高优先级】
{{@镜头数}} SHOTS, hard cuts only at {{@切点}} s. Every cut has a reason (a look, a line, a reaction, a movement); each shot opens exactly where the last one ended, and no line and no action restarts after a cut.
TALL FRAME: the frame is tall and narrow. {{同框}} Faces stay in the upper two thirds of the frame; anyone who comes or goes moves toward or away from the lens.
UPRIGHT: the camera is always level and the right way up: floor at the bottom, gravity pulling down, heads above feet.
ONE IMAGE: every shot is one continuous image of one real space through one lens: no split screen, no panels, no picture in picture, no double exposure.
SHOT AND REVERSE SHOT: {{正反打}}
CAMERA FEELS: the camera moves only when a feeling changes, eases in as someone gives themselves away, and holds still while a feeling is held in; it never zooms and never cuts away before a reaction lands.
【本段状态】
STATE: Each change appears only at the moment it happens, then stays: {{状态}}
{{@镜头}}
【结束状态】
END STATE: the last frame is the end of shot {{@末镜号}}: {{结束}}
{{@结尾固定}}
不生成BGM：不要音乐、配乐、旋律，只保留{{@BGM对白}}呼吸声、{{环境声}}和动作的声音。
